        "## Process EEG Data for Gamma Waves\n",
        "\n",
        "### Subtask:\n",
        "Define a function to load an .edf file, apply a bandpass filter to isolate gamma wave activity, and calculate a representative measure of gamma power for each relevant EEG channel over specified time segments.\n"
