      },
      "source": [
        "**Reasoning**:\n",
        "I will define a Python function named `process_eeg_for_gamma_power` that encapsulates the logic for loading an EDF file, applying a gamma bandpass filter, and calculating gamma power for each channel as specified in the instructions. This function will return the gamma power values.\n",
        "\n"
      ]
