        "## Refine EEG Processing Function for Gamma Waves\n",
        "\n",
        "### Subtask:\n",
        "Modify the `process_eeg_for_gamma_power` function to load .edf files, apply a bandpass filter to isolate gamma wave activity, split data into fixed-length epochs, and calculate the mean power spectral density within the gamma band (30-100 Hz) averaged across these epochs for each relevant EEG channel.\n"
