        "**Reasoning**:\n",
        "Now that the data is in the correct 'long' format, I will perform a two-way repeated-measures ANOVA for each relevant EEG channel using the `statsmodels` library. This will help identify channels with significant main effects of group, condition, or a group-by-condition interaction.\n",
